/* rest-poison-god.irh -- fixture for tools/check_rest_poison.sh (bd inc-gmrj).

   ONE test god. Joining it (wizard mode "Become Divine Champion") throws
   EV_BLESSING once with 30000 favour (src/Debug.cpp), and the FAVOUR_CHART
   below is copied from tools/fixtures/periodic-interval-gods.irh: its first
   rung (1000) sits under 30000 and its second (50000) sits over it, so a
   fresh follower always lands on level 1 and this handler fires exactly
   once, never again on the same character. The one-shot guard is
   getGodLevel(...)==1, the same gate periodic-interval-gods.irh and
   heal-maladies-god.irh use.

   The blessing calls GainPermStati directly for exactly one malady --
   POISONED -- with a real stock Effect resource, $"arsenic". Val and Mag are
   pinned to 0 rather than left at GainPermStati's -1 default. The shared
   poison loop (Creature::PoisonPulse, formerly Creature::DoTurn's POISONED
   block) reads TEFF(S->eID) unconditionally every turn the stati is held, so
   eID 0 would name no real resource; see heal-maladies-god.irh's header for
   the crash that produced from the same gap.

   WHY ARSENIC, AND WHY THE PLAYER SURVIVES IT. lib/threats.irh:389 declares
   Poison "arsenic": cval 4 (a Fort save every 4 turns), sval 13 (DC 13),
   lval 3 (three successful saves overcome it), xval AD_DACO pval 1d4 (1d4
   Constitution damage on a failed save). A night's rest advances
   ((HOUR_TURNS*8)/100)*Percent turns; HOUR_TURNS is 18000
   (inc/Defines.h:132), so a full-Percent rest advances 1440 turns -- 360
   save opportunities at cval 4. A character's Fortitude save at the levels
   these fixtures build is high enough against DC 13 that three successes
   land long before three failures drain 1d4 CON each; the check pins its
   seed and asserts the resolved outcome, not the survival.

   NOT part of the shipped module: tools/check_rest_poison.sh splices this
   file onto the END of a scratch copy of lib/main.irc, under logs/, for the
   span of its own run only. No tracked lib/ file is ever touched. */

God "Rest Poison Test God"
  {
    Lists:
      * FAVOUR_CHART
          1000
          50000
          60000
          70000
          80000
          90000
          100000
          110000
          120000
          130000;
    On Event EV_BLESSING {
      if (EActor->getGodLevel($"Rest Poison Test God") == 1) {
        EActor->GainPermStati(POISONED,NULL,SS_MISC,0,0,$"arsenic");
        }
      return NOTHING;
      };
  }
